id: pm-glossary-sdk-settings
title: Adopt SDK settings-section reads consistently in glossary adapters
description: Implement pm-glossary scope of companion pm-cli-website-m8dy (G4); use public readSettingsSection and preserve package policy validation. Coordinate with pm-glossary-yrza in one PR.
type: Task
status: closed
priority: 2
tags: []
created_at: "2026-11-06T15:45:45.620Z"
updated_at: "2026-11-06T21:17:17.830Z"
closed_at: "2026-11-06T21:17:17.465Z"
completed_at: "2026-11-06T21:17:17.465Z"
author: codex-sol
acceptance_criteria: Directory and command adapters agree on custom and absent policy; typed malformed settings refusals; customized native schema and sibling settings survive; real non-git tracker tests with revert proof
parent: pm-glossary-gjws
resolution: Delivered by merged PR #6 (3877fc1daca28ca575689aaf73c91e55169a4403); verified against main source and tests.
expected_result: "Directory and command adapters agree on default/custom policy, return typed invalid/malformed settings refusals and preserve native schema, sibling sections, settings bytes and workspace history."
actual_result: npm run build && node --test --test-concurrency=2 test/settings.test.ts test/contracts.test.ts test/commands.test.ts passed 12/12 through pinned pm test on main. Both adapters use SDK readSettingsSection and shared validateSettings; no-git tests verify all requested preservation and refusal cases. Existing disposable revert coverage removes the directory lookup fix and each adapter validator.
comments[5]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-11-06T15:46:07.662Z",codex-sol,"Companion pm-cli-website-m8dy (G4), read only: replace the directory adapter normalized-core section lookup with readSettingsSection. Share strict glossary policy validation across directory and command adapters; retain package output budget and witness rules. Real scratch non-git trackers will cover absent/custom/invalid policy, malformed documents, custom native schema and sibling sections. Coordinate native controls with pm-glossary-yrza in the same PR."
  "2026-11-06T15:56:38.056Z",codex-sol,"Implemented shared section validation through readSettingsSection in both adapters. The 12 focused tests pass on real non-git SDK trackers, including absent/default/custom policy, historical numeric strings, invalid policy, malformed documents, custom native schema, sibling policy and unchanged settings/workspace history. Lint/typecheck/docstrings and zero-duplication gates pass. Full npm/Bun gates and disposable behavioral revert proofs are in progress."
  "2026-11-06T16:31:21.206Z",codex-sol,"Validation complete: focused build plus settings/contracts/commands tests pass 12/12. npm run release:check and bun run release:check pass with isolated HOME and Git config: 139/139 coverage tests, all 10 runtime files at 100 percent statements (461/461), branches (283/283), functions (112/112), lines (396/396); zero duplication and production vulnerabilities; packed npm/Bun journeys pass. Disposable revert proofs: restoring the original directory core-settings lookup fails BOTH new tests; removing either directory or command SDK section validation fails the refusal test. All 51 mutants fail as expected and the restored implementation passes 103/103 tests. The Bun gate ran through the linked pm test on pm-glossary-yrza. Identity/privacy passes for all staged files; existing native history remains a byte-prefix extension of main. Ready for one PR and the required bot-review/CI loop; leave this item open for orchestrator verification."
  "2026-11-06T21:13:27.678Z",codex-sol,"Closure audit of merged PR #6 (3877fc1daca28ca575689aaf73c91e55169a4403): both adapters call readSettingsSection with validateSettings. Real non-git SDK tests cover absent/custom policy, typed malformed/invalid refusals, unchanged bytes/history and peer schema/sections. Verify focused tests and both release gates before closure; native output-control blocker stays unclosed."
  "2026-11-06T21:17:13.082Z",codex-sol,"Closure evidence verified directly on main: npm run build && node --test --test-concurrency=2 test/settings.test.ts test/contracts.test.ts test/commands.test.ts passed 12/12 through pinned pm test on main. Both adapters use SDK readSettingsSection and shared validateSettings; no-git tests verify all requested preservation and refusal cases. Existing disposable revert coverage removes the directory lookup fix and each adapter validator. Final closure branch runs both npm and Bun release gates after changelog regeneration; native-control item pm-glossary-yrza remains blocked."
